    "title": "Writing the reflective commentary",
    "summary": "Narrator: Period 4. Mei finishes her script and writes: 'In my scene, Juliet comes home and hides the potion.' Mr H: Mei. I have just read your script. Never retell your own plot. Tell me why.",
    "startSec": 417.17,
