    "title": "Form, structure & the Volta",
    "summary": "Mr H: *Stanza* is Italian for 'room'. Count lines from two to eight: Cool Tigers Quietly Creep, Silently Stalking Owls — couplet, tercet, quatrain, cinquain, sestet, septet, octave. Nib: End-stoppe...",
