        "who": "mrh",
        "text": "Mr H: Know ballad, elegy, ode, haiku, villanelle, cyclical structure — Blake changing 'Could frame' to 'Dare frame' — and free verse: no fixed rhyme or metre, yet deliberate line breaks!"
