    "summary": "Addie: Ooh, metaphor time! 'The rain fell like cats and dogs, and the MRT was as cold as ice!' Nib: Clichés, darling! Dead comparisons examiners have read ten thousand times! Reject your first idea.",
    "startSec": 146.27,
