    "summary": "Narrator: The rain eases. Room 8H packs its descriptive toolkit. Mei: Memory hooks! Senses: Some Hungry Sharks Taste Toes. Sentences: Some Lazy Cats Fear Mice. Paragraphs: TiPToP. Redrafting: ARMS!",
